<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Black/Decker cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Black/Decker cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Russell Leavitt downgraded Black &amp; Decker Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- also cut the earnings estimate to $2.65 per share from $2.75-$3 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares fell one to 35-3/8.</p>
</text>
